00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.860
Griot is a citrus-marinated pork

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.600
that's then either baked or fried.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.430
I prepped the pork the
day before; I diced it

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:30.170
and then I marinated it
in all this lovely citrus.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.800
And now I'm prepping my pikliz.

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:34.340
There wasn't the tri-color cabbage,

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.691
so I'm just using the plain cabbage.

00:03:35.691 --> 00:03:36.717
So I'm going to cover this

00:03:36.717 --> 00:03:39.110
and let it marinate for about two hours.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:42.740
All right, I'm cooking this
pork for about 30 minutes.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.310
I feel like after the last
week of food around the world,

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:47.240
