(dish clanks)

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:44.520
whoa, shh, geez, Oh my god.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.630
I dropped my flour.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:47.350
Now frybread is a dish that's served

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:50.190
